      "Samuel H. Miller, Class of 2013"
    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Samuel H. Miller is co-chairman emeritus of Forest City Enterprises, Inc. A key stakeholder since 1947, Miller has overseen various areas of Forest City. He is particularly credited with spearheading the Company’s move into land development. Miller has served as treasurer since 1992. He was named chairman of the board in 1993, and was joined by Albert B. Ratner as co-chairman of the board in 1995."
    ]
  },
